  "title": "Nordic Regional NWP Models",
  "description": "Hourly atmospheric analysis and forecast archive derived from two regional numerical weather prediction models: the Danish HARMONIE model at 2 km resolution covering Greenland and Iceland, and the MetCoOp MEPS model at 2.5 km resolution covering the broader Nordic region. The dataset is constructed by archiving the first three forecast steps of each model run to produce an effective hourly analysis product. Data is stored in Icechunk format for cloud-native array access.",
